<title>UK: UK new car registrations fell 5.4 pct in Nov.</title>
<headline>UK new car registrations fell 5.4 pct in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>British new car registrations</p>
<p> NOVEMBER	    135,342 vs 143,055   - down 5.4 pct</p>
<p>1996 yr to date  1,947,309 vs 1,873,826 - up 3.9 pct</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
